message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the repository URL and commit documented in
  docs/RESEARCH_MONOGRAPH.md (section 9).
title: Multimodel-CEP-Benchmark
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Haydarah-8/Multimodel-CEP-Benchmark'
abstract: >-
  Multimodel evaluation of LLM safety under structured prompt shifts: a
  category-stratified taxonomy for refusal, partial compliance, and unsafe outputs;
  reproducible pipelines, statistical analysis, and boundary stability under
  rule-based prompt mutation. Implementation package in llm-safety-experiment/.
